    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Are you ready for another rendezvous to the most romantic place on earth\u2026 FRANCE. The breathtaking Eiffel tower, the classic Castles and historical Museums. French Alps, world class wineries and a treat for the literature lovers, trip to Shakespeare and company. <br />\r\nHit a new level at every location and play 8 minigames as you go along. All you\u2019ve got to do is find stuff\u2014match silhouettes, solve riddles, and spot objects. Make sure to collect all the fleur de lis and flags you see\u2014there are 60 each\u2014to unlock an Unlimited Mode and bonus minigames. Sounds fun? Go on, then. Start your French Vacation!",
    "about_the_game": "Are you ready for another rendezvous to the most romantic place on earth\u2026 FRANCE. The breathtaking Eiffel tower, the classic Castles and historical Museums. French Alps, world class wineries and a treat for the literature lovers, trip to Shakespeare and company. <br />\r\nHit a new level at every location and play 8 minigames as you go along. All you\u2019ve got to do is find stuff\u2014match silhouettes, solve riddles, and spot objects. Make sure to collect all the fleur de lis and flags you see\u2014there are 60 each\u2014to unlock an Unlimited Mode and bonus minigames. Sounds fun? Go on, then. Start your French Vacation!",
    "short_description": "Let's take a vacation across stunning France, with fun trivia.",
